  "problem": "The following table shows the amount, in grams, of flax oil obtained from the corresponding amount of flaxseed:\n\n| Oil | Seed |\n| --- | --- |\n| $315$ | $945$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nThe ratio of the amount of flax oil to the amount of flaxseed is always the same. By rounding the given data to the nearest hundred, approximate the amount of flax oil that can be obtained from $600$ grams of seed.",
